  "guid": "com.markosz.stashmanagementhelper",
  "name": "Stash Management Helper",
  "slug": "stash-management-helper",
  "teaser": "Enhances stash management with extra sorting features. This can sort your stash long after the default sorting fails.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2514.png",
  "downloads": 22564,
  "favourites_count": 33,
  "description": "<h3>Features</h3>\n<h2>Customizable Stash Sorting</h2>\n<p>- Create your own sorting strategy or use enhanced EFT default sorting</p>\n<p>- Automatically fold items to optimize space</p>\n<p>- Merge identical item stacks</p>\n<p>- Smart item rotation for optimal fit</p>\n<p>- Configurable empty rows at the top for item dumping</p>\n<p>- Bottom-up sorting option</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/41615461/425192513-f2339a85-65ef-4e22-9bdc-6d01b43a2270.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dFRcNwVFEKTxhtveNWyfHMkmD-MsTVXgUngkRugOh4I\" alt=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/41615461/425192513-f2339a85-65ef-4e22-9bdc-6d01b43a2270.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dFRcNwVFEKTxhtveNWyfHMkmD-MsTVXgUngkRugOh4I\" /></p>\n<h2>Sorting Strategies</h2>\n<p>Configure sorting based on multiple criteria:</p>\n<p>- Container size</p>\n<p>- Item size</p>\n<p>- Item type (with customizable type ordering, kinda broken, very much WIP)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Markosz22/StashManagementHelper/assets/41615461/521ecce7-ceda-45cc-8ab2-7539cb11b550\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Markosz22/StashManagementHelper/assets/41615461/521ecce7-ceda-45cc-8ab2-7539cb11b550\" alt=\"521ecce7-ceda-45cc-8ab2-7539cb11b550\" /></a></p>\n<p>Usage</p>\n<p>1. Configure settings according to your preferences (default settings optimized for maximum space efficiency)</p>\n<p>2. Press the sort button</p>\n<p>3. Global options (1) apply to both default and custom sorting methods</p>\n<p>Custom Configuration</p>\n<p>After first use, a <code>customSortConfig.json</code> file will be generated alongside the DLL. This file allows you to:</p>\n<p>- Modify <code>sortOrder</code> to prioritize different sorting criteria</p>\n<p>- Customize <code>itemTypeOrder</code> to define the sequence of item types when using type-based sorting</p>\n<h3>Recommended mods for maximum stash QOL and compatibility notes:</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1769-stash-search/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Stash Search by Dirtbikercj</a>. DO NOT SORT in filtered view (while searching), items can mess up and need restart to see again.<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1152-inventory-organizing-features/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Inventory Organizing Features by Nightingale</a> originally. Waiting for updated version by someone. Fully compatible.</p>\n",
